4160,1
Query:
--Description: Return the human-readable names of every product that exceeded its centred 3-month moving-average by a factor > 2 in at least one month of 2017.
WITH ratio_2017 AS (
    SELECT  ms.product_id,
            ROUND( ms.qty /
                   AVG(ms.qty) OVER (
                       PARTITION BY ms.product_id
                       ORDER BY ms.mth
                       ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND 1 FOLLOWING
                   ), 4) AS ratio_adj
    FROM    monthly_sales AS ms
    WHERE   ms.mth BETWEEN '2017-01-01' AND '2017-12-31'
)
SELECT DISTINCT p.id   AS product_id,
                p.name AS product_name
FROM   products  AS p
JOIN   ratio_2017 AS r
       ON r.product_id = p.id
WHERE  r.ratio_adj > 2
ORDER  BY p.id
Answer:
product_id,product_name
4160,Reindeer Fuel
4280,Hoppy Crude Oil
Task: Based on monthly sales data starting in January 2016 and using a centered moving average to adjust for seasonality, which products had a seasonality-adjusted sales ratio that stayed consistently above 2 for every month in the year 2017?

